{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>According to all that I show you.</b> Here — <b>the pattern of the Tabernacle</b>: this verse is connected to the verse above it, from ״And they shall make Me a sanctuary״ — ״according to all that I show you.״" "<b>And so shall you make.</b> For the generations (Sanhedrin 16) — if one of the vessels is lost, or when you make vessels for the eternal House, such as the tables, lampstands, basins, and stands that Solomon made — you shall make them after the pattern of these. And if the verse were not connected to that above it, it would not have written ״וְכֵן תַּעֲשׂוּ״ but simply ״כֵּן תַּעֲשׂוּ״, and it would be speaking about the making of the Tent of Meeting and its vessels."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:26.009688284Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}